graph TB
    Start([🧪 STS Validator<br/>Start Performance Test]) --> LargeCodebase
    
    subgraph LargeCodebase[" 📦 LARGE CODEBASE TEST "]
        Init[Create large test codebase<br/>10,000 files, 500K LOC] --> Analyze[Run holistic discovery<br/>Full codebase scan]
        
        Analyze --> StartTimer[⏱️ Start timer]
        StartTimer --> Discovery[Discovery operations:<br/>• AST parsing<br/>• Dependency mapping<br/>• Complexity analysis<br/>• Pattern detection]
        
        Discovery --> EndTimer[⏱️ Stop timer]
        EndTimer --> CheckTime{Time<br/>< 15s?}
        
        CheckTime -->|No| SlowPerf[❌ Performance degraded<br/>Time: {X}s > 15s threshold]
        CheckTime -->|Yes| FastPerf[✅ Large codebase OK<br/>Time: 8.5s]
    end
    
    SlowPerf --> FailResult[❌ FAIL Result]
    FastPerf --> ConcurrentOps
    
    subgraph ConcurrentOps[" 🔀 CONCURRENT OPERATIONS TEST "]
        InitConcurrent[Initialize concurrent test] --> SpawnOps[Spawn 5 concurrent operations:<br/>1. plan feature-A<br/>2. tdd workflow-B<br/>3. sanitize code-C<br/>4. refine system<br/>5. review architecture]
        
        SpawnOps --> MonitorOps[Monitor concurrent execution:<br/>• Thread safety<br/>• Resource conflicts<br/>• Deadlocks<br/>• Race conditions]
        
        MonitorOps --> CheckConflicts{Resource<br/>conflicts?}
        CheckConflicts -->|Yes| ConflictDetected[❌ Resource conflict detected<br/>Operations blocked]
        CheckConflicts -->|No| CheckDeadlock
        
        CheckDeadlock{Deadlocks<br/>detected?}
        CheckDeadlock -->|Yes| DeadlockDetected[❌ Deadlock detected<br/>System hung]
        CheckDeadlock -->|No| CheckCompletion
        
        CheckCompletion[Wait for all operations] --> AllComplete{All ops<br/>complete?}
        AllComplete -->|No| OpFailed[❌ Operation failed<br/>Incomplete execution]
        AllComplete -->|Yes| ConcurrentPass[✅ Concurrent ops OK<br/>5/5 successful]
    end
    
    ConflictDetected --> FailResult
    DeadlockDetected --> FailResult
    OpFailed --> FailResult
    ConcurrentPass --> BrainQuery
    
    subgraph BrainQuery[" 🧠 BRAIN QUERY PERFORMANCE "]
        QueryInit[Initialize query test] --> Query1000[Execute 1000 queries:<br/>• Tier 1: 300 queries<br/>• Tier 2: 400 queries<br/>• Tier 3: 300 queries]
        
        Query1000 --> MeasureQuery[⏱️ Measure query times]
        MeasureQuery --> QueryTier1[Tier 1 avg: {X}ms]
        
        QueryTier1 --> CheckT1{T1 avg<br/>< 100ms?}
        CheckT1 -->|No| SlowQuery[❌ Query performance slow]
        CheckT1 -->|Yes| QueryTier2
        
        QueryTier2[Tier 2 avg: {Y}ms] --> CheckT2{T2 avg<br/>< 150ms?}
        CheckT2 -->|No| SlowQuery
        CheckT2 -->|Yes| QueryTier3
        
        QueryTier3[Tier 3 avg: {Z}ms] --> CheckT3{T3 avg<br/>< 100ms?}
        CheckT3 -->|No| SlowQuery
        CheckT3 -->|Yes| QueryPass[✅ Brain queries OK<br/>Avg: 42ms overall]
    end
    
    SlowQuery --> FailResult
    QueryPass --> MemoryTest
    
    subgraph MemoryTest[" 💾 MEMORY USAGE TEST "]
        MemInit[Monitor memory usage] --> BaselineMem[Baseline memory: {M} MB]
        
        BaselineMem --> StressTest[Run stress test:<br/>• 100 concurrent operations<br/>• 50,000 conversations<br/>• Large file processing]
        
        StressTest --> PeakMem[Peak memory: {P} MB]
        PeakMem --> MemIncrease[Calculate increase:<br/>{P} - {M} = {I} MB]
        
        MemIncrease --> CheckMem{Memory<br/>< 500MB?}
        CheckMem -->|No| MemLeak[❌ Memory leak suspected<br/>Usage: {P} MB]
        CheckMem -->|Yes| MemPass[✅ Memory usage OK<br/>Peak: {P} MB]
    end
    
    MemLeak --> FailResult
    MemPass --> MetricsCollection
    
    subgraph MetricsCollection[" 📊 METRICS COLLECTION "]
        Collect[Collect all metrics:<br/>• Large codebase time: 8.5s<br/>• Concurrent operations: 5 successful<br/>• Brain query avg: 42ms<br/>• Tier 1 query: 38ms<br/>• Tier 2 query: 48ms<br/>• Tier 3 query: 40ms<br/>• Peak memory: 287 MB]
        
        Validate[Validate thresholds:<br/>• Codebase < 15s ✓<br/>• Concurrent ops ≥ 5 ✓<br/>• Query avg < 100ms ✓<br/>• Memory < 500MB ✓]
    end
    
    Collect --> Validate
    Validate --> PassResult[✅ PASS Result<br/>All Criteria Met]
    
    PassResult --> UpdateBaseline[📝 Update sts-baseline.json<br/>capability: performance<br/>status: PASS]
    
    FailResult --> UpdateBaseline
    
    UpdateBaseline --> End([🎯 Performance Capability<br/>Validation Complete])
    
